00:34:23.928 --> 00:34:26.064 align:start size:84% position:16%
he's more authentic
than other candidates,

00:34:26.064 --> 00:34:27.298
therefore he would win.

00:34:27.298 --> 00:34:29.067
If you don't like open borders

00:34:29.067 --> 00:34:32.170
