00:36:05.096 --> 00:36:07.565
that you were gonna be
talking about politics?

00:36:07.565 --> 00:36:09.066
Because you spend a lot of time,

00:36:09.066 --> 00:36:10.434 align:start size:97% position:3%
you know it's not that
