00:38:01.245 --> 00:38:04.048 align:start size:97% position:3%
and have you been
ostracized by other people?

00:38:04.048 --> 00:38:05.950 align:start size:97% position:3%
- Yes.
- And other kind of headaches

00:38:05.950 --> 00:38:08.452 align:start size:94% position:6%
because I think humanizing
some of that stuff,

00:38:08.452 --> 00:38:12.356 align:start size:97% position:3%
you know, you're not just some
spinning neuron out there.

00:38:12.356 --> 00:38:14.258 align:start size:84% position:16%
You're a human,
you've got a family

00:38:14.258 --> 00:38:16.827 align:start size:88% position:13%
and people you work
with and the rest of it.

00:38:16.827 --> 00:38:18.296
It's not that this has no cost.

00:38:18.296 --> 00:38:20.731 align:start size:97% position:3%
- Some might say a very
good looking human but yes.

00:38:22.366 --> 00:38:24.035
- A gorgeous, bronze man.

00:38:25.136 --> 00:38:27.672 align:start size:84% position:16%
- So I'll answer
this in several ways.

00:38:27.672 --> 00:38:29.073 align:start size:94% position:6%
So one of the things that
people often tell me.

00:38:29.073 --> 00:38:31.409 align:start size:97% position:3%
Well you know, you're
protected by tenure professor

00:38:31.409 --> 00:38:34.211 align:start size:84% position:16%
so it doesn't take
such courage Dr. Saad.

00:38:34.211 --> 00:38:37.181
Well, in 2017 I had to,

00:38:37.181 --> 00:38:40.184
