00:38:59.437 --> 00:39:02.373
because I didn't know when
they were gonna come at me.

00:39:02.373 --> 00:39:04.709
Are the three guys that are
in the elevator with me,

00:39:04.709 --> 00:39:07.244 align:start size:88% position:13%
are they the ones who
are gonna decapitate me?

00:39:07.244 --> 00:39:09.413 align:start size:84% position:16%
So tenure doesn't
protect you from that.

00:39:09.413 --> 00:39:13.517
Tenure doesn't protect you
from all of the opportunities

00:39:13.517 --> 00:39:14.952
I would've had as an academic.

00:39:14.952 --> 00:39:17.521
Other job offers, higher salary.

